  "details": "How about a simple playerlist? something that can be added onto the wings in the quick menu and displays just the username and the platform they're using. Bonus points if you can click on a player's name and it opens them up in the quick menu for easy access to mute, enable etc. \nIt's one of the mods I find myself missing a lot since it made muting or blocking disruptive users, and enabling the avatar of someone I want to see all the features off easier in crowded worlds. It's hard to select someone's hitbox if there's a bunch of people piled on top of or near eachother",
